    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "gym_normal_010_receptionist_01",
      "hash64": "FE35EED32F281E40",
      "text": "Welcome to the Medali Gym!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "gym_normal_010_receptionist_02",
      "hash64": "FE35F1D32F282359",
      "text": "Let me register you as a challenger. Your name is\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)], yes?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "gym_normal_010_receptionist_03",
      "hash64": "FE35F0D32F2821A6",
      "text": "Great! Now, in order to face Gym Leader Larry,\\nyou’ll first need to pass the Gym Test.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "gym_normal_010_receptionist_04",
      "hash64": "FE35F3D32F2826BF",
      "text": "Here at the Medali Gym, that means [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]ordering a[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]special secret menu item[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 49,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 54,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "gym_normal_010_receptionist_05",
      "hash64": "FE35F2D32F28250C",
      "text": "Specifically, a menu item at the [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Treasure Eatery[VAR 0xFF00(0000)],\\na much-loved restaurant here in Medali.\\c\\nOrder correctly, and you pass!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "gym_normal_010_receptionist_06",
      "hash64": "FE35F5D32F282A25",
      "text": "Right now, there are three other challengers\\naround town attempting this Gym Test.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "gym_normal_010_receptionist_07",
      "hash64": "FE35F4D32F282872",
      "text": "Each challenger has been given a different clue\\nthat’ll help them discover the secret dish. You’ll\\r\\nbe given a clue as well.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "gym_normal_010_receptionist_08",
      "hash64": "FE35F7D32F282D8B",
      "text": "Please find and battle the other challengers.\\nThe loser must tell the winner their clue!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "gym_normal_010_receptionist_09",
      "hash64": "FE35F6D32F282BD8",
      "text": "Your goal is to gather clues and use them to\\ndetermine the secret dish, then order it from\\r\\nthe waiter at the Treasure Eatery.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "gym_normal_010_receptionist_10",
      "hash64": "FE3289D32F253CCA",
      "text": "Only the challenger who’s able to order correctly\\nwill pass the test!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "gym_normal_010_receptionist_11",
      "hash64": "FE328AD32F253E7D",
      "text": "Your clue is to find out [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]how the regulars season[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]their dishes[VAR 0xFF00(0000)].",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
